- Log certificate receipt in the Q2 playbook before scheduling Marcus Holt berth clearance for boarding trials.

## Limits

This gate applies to P9-GANG gangway passenger boarding only — not P9-GATE fare lane commissioning, SSB-DRILL life-vest spot checks, or HarborPass migration outage windows. Load test cert does not replace the contractor shift ban on berth 9B.

